<body class="dental" id="top">
  <header class="d-top"><div class="d-wrap d-nav"><a class="d-logo" href="/" aria-label="LeadsFlo home"><BrandMark theme="light" /><svg class="d-logo-icon" viewBox="0 0 30 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4C3 7 4 14 7 20l3 9c2 3 4-1 5-7 1-4 2-4 3 0 1 6 3 10 5 7l3-9c3-6 4-13-1-16-4-3-7 1-10 1S12 1 8 4Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></a><button class="d-hamb" type="button" aria-controls="d-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open navigation"><span class="d-hamb-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></button><nav class="d-menu" id="d-menu" aria-label="Dental page navigation"><a href="#services">Capabilities</a><a href="#journey">Patient journey</a><a href="#planner">Growth planner</a><a href="#insights">Guides</a><a href="#faq">FAQs</a><a class="d-btn" href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a strategy call ↗</a></nav></div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="d-hero"><div class="d-wrap d-hero-grid"><div><span class="d-kicker">LEADSFLO / DENTAL GROWTH SYSTEMS</span><h1>More qualified inquiries. <em>Better patient journeys.</em></h1><p class="d-lead">Marketing for dental practices that want relevant new-patient interest, implant consultation requests and reliable follow-up—not another spreadsheet full of unanswered leads.</p><div class="d-actions"><a class="d-btn" href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss your dental growth ↗</a><a class="d-btn ghost" href="#journey">Explore the approach</a></div><div class="d-tags"><span>Google Search + Meta</span><span>Service-specific funnels</span><span>CRM + scheduling</span></div></div><div class="d-visual" role="img" aria-label="Original illustration of a tooth and a connected consultation journey"><span class="d-visual-pill">A CONNECTED PATH TO CONSULTATION</span><svg class="d-tooth" viewBox="0 0 300 340" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="enamel" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#fff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#c9e9e7"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M74 38C39 57 32 105 49 167c14 48 39 133 64 132 20-1 14-80 37-95 23 15 17 94 37 95 25 1 50-84 64-132 17-62 10-110-25-129-25-13-47 1-76 11-29-10-51-24-76-11Z" fill="url(#enamel)" stroke="#c0e8e0" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M75 90c13-30 34-30 62-21" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M167 69c22-4 45-11 63 10" stroke="#a0d4d3" stroke-width="5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M96 167c25 22 83 26 111 0" stroke="#97cbc8" stroke-width="3" fill="none" opacity=".5"/><circle cx="244" cy="72" r="8" fill="#dbb46b"/><path d="M244 55v34M227 72h34" stroke="#dbb46b" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="d-visual-copy"><div><strong>Inquiry → Qualification → Consultation</strong><span>One connected marketing and response workflow</span></div><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 34 34" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="16" fill="#0e8786"/><path d="m11 18 4 4 9-10" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></div></div></section>
    <div class="d-marquee" aria-label="Dental marketing capabilities"><div class="d-marquee-track">{Array.from({length:2}).map(()=>["Dental Implant Campaigns","Google Ads","Meta Creative","New-Patient Funnels","Consultation Requests","Lead Qualification","CRM Follow-Up","Scheduling Workflows"].map(item=><span class="d-chip">{item}</span>))}</div></div>
    <section class="d-section" id="services"><div class="d-wrap"><span class="d-eyebrow">BUILT AROUND YOUR PRACTICE</span><h2>Different dental services need different campaigns.</h2><p class="d-section-intro">A patient looking for an everyday checkup is not following the same decision process as someone researching an implant consultation. We separate intent, landing page messaging and next steps.</p><div class="d-grid" role="group" aria-label="Explore dental marketing services"><button class="d-service active" type="button" data-service="implants"><strong>Dental implants</strong><span>Research-stage and consultation-intent inquiries</span></button><button class="d-service" type="button" data-service="cosmetic"><strong>Cosmetic dentistry</strong><span>Clear aligners, veneers and smile consultations</span></button><button class="d-service" type="button" data-service="general"><strong>General dentistry</strong><span>Local new-patient demand and recall journeys</span></button><button class="d-service" type="button" data-service="multi"><strong>Multi-location practices</strong><span>Location-specific campaigns and lead routing</span></button></div><div class="d-service-detail" aria-live="polite"><div><span class="d-detail-tag" id="d-service-kicker">CAMPAIGN PATH / IMPLANTS</span><h3 id="d-service-title">High-consideration consultations</h3><p id="d-service-copy">Match treatment research intent with educational, accurate information and an easy way to request a professional assessment.</p></div><div><span class="d-detail-tag">WHAT THE PRACTICE RECEIVES</span><p id="d-service-result">Service interest, preferred location, contact permission and a trackable consultation-request workflow—without sending sensitive clinical information to ad platforms.</p></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="d-section dark" id="journey"><div class="d-wrap"><span class="d-eyebrow">FROM FIRST SEARCH TO A REAL CONVERSATION</span><h2>A patient journey the front desk can actually manage.</h2><p class="d-section-intro">Explore the four stages. Each one has its own job: capture interest, establish relevant fit, contact the person and verify the appointment status.</p><div class="d-path" role="group" aria-label="Explore the inquiry workflow"><button type="button" class="d-path-step active" data-step="0"><small>01 / ATTRACT</small><strong>Search or social inquiry</strong></button><button type="button" class="d-path-step" data-step="1"><small>02 / CAPTURE</small><strong>Focused request form</strong></button><button type="button" class="d-path-step" data-step="2"><small>03 / RESPOND</small><strong>Front-desk follow-up</strong></button><button type="button" class="d-path-step" data-step="3"><small>04 / VERIFY</small><strong>Consultation confirmed</strong></button></div><div class="d-path-panel"><div><strong id="d-path-title">Start with relevant intent</strong><p id="d-path-copy">Separate implant consultation searches, cosmetic treatment interests and routine local appointment demand. Send each group to the right message and next step.</p></div><span class="d-eyebrow" id="d-path-status">STAGE 01 / INQUIRY</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="d-section soft"><div class="d-wrap"><span class="d-eyebrow">BEYOND THE FIRST FORM SUBMISSION</span><h2>Connected systems, not disconnected leads.</h2><p class="d-section-intro">These illustrations show possible marketing processes, not clinic case studies or patient outcomes.</p><div class="d-visual-grid"><article class="d-feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 150 150" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="75" cy="75" r="56" stroke="#0c8786" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="75" cy="75" r="32" stroke="#0c8786" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M75 8v38m0 58v38M8 75h38m58 0h38" stroke="#0c8786" stroke-width="2"/></svg><h3>Intent-matched advertising</h3><p>Connect search themes and creative to the dental service someone is researching.</p></article><article class="d-feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 150 150" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="25" y="16" width="100" height="118" rx="13" stroke="#a5814a" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M42 47h65M42 66h65M42 85h37" stroke="#a5814a" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="105" cy="104" r="16" stroke="#a5814a" stroke-width="3"/></svg><h3>Useful qualification</h3><p>Collect appropriate service interest, location and scheduling preferences with minimal friction.</p></article><article class="d-feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 150 150" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 76h33l18-35 18 70 19-35h20" stroke="#387c9f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="75" cy="75" r="57" stroke="#387c9f" stroke-width="2"/></svg><h3>Timely follow-up</h3><p>Assign inquiries to the right front-desk team with clear actions and recorded outcomes.</p></article><article class="d-feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 150 150" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="28" y="33" width="95" height="94" rx="9" stroke="#478c6e" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M28 58h95M51 24v18M100 24v18" stroke="#478c6e" stroke-width="4"/><path d="m54 92 12 12 27-29" stroke="#478c6e" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Appointment visibility</h3><p>Differentiate an ad click, a request and a genuinely confirmed consultation.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="d-section" id="planner"><div class="d-wrap"><span class="d-eyebrow">INTERACTIVE / SCENARIO PLANNER</span><h2>See how inquiries could move through your practice.</h2><p class="d-section-intro">Adjust the assumptions to illustrate the math. These are hypothetical inputs, not performance forecasts or promised patient volume.</p><div class="d-calculator"><div class="d-controls"><div class="d-field"><label for="d-inquiries">Monthly valid inquiries <output id="d-inquiries-out">60</output></label><input id="d-inquiries" type="range" min="10" max="300" step="5" value="60" /></div><div class="d-field"><label for="d-contact">Contacted successfully <output id="d-contact-out">60%</output></label><input id="d-contact" type="range" min="10" max="100" step="5" value="60" /></div><div class="d-field"><label for="d-book">Consultations booked from reached contacts <output id="d-book-out">45%</output></label><input id="d-book" type="range" min="5" max="100" step="5" value="45" /></div><div class="d-field"><label for="d-show">Appointment attendance <output id="d-show-out">75%</output></label><input id="d-show" type="range" min="10" max="100" step="5" value="75" /></div><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#647b7b">Illustrative conversion stages only. No patient treatment acceptance or clinical revenue estimates are implied.</p></div><div class="d-results" aria-live="polite"><span>HYPOTHETICAL MONTHLY OUTCOMES</span><div class="d-stat"><div><small>Contacts reached</small></div><strong id="d-contacted-result">36</strong></div><div class="d-stat"><div><small>Consultations booked</small></div><strong id="d-booked-result">16</strong></div><div class="d-stat"><div><small>Consultations attended</small></div><strong id="d-attended-result">12</strong></div><p class="d-note">Appointments can only be considered confirmed when your booking system or team verifies them. Calculator outputs do not represent real LeadsFlo or clinic results.</p><a class="d-btn" href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss a realistic plan ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="d-section soft" id="faq"><div class="d-wrap"><span class="d-eyebrow">GOOD QUESTIONS / CLEAR ANSWERS</span><h2>What dental practices ask before investing.</h2><div class="d-faqs">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
    <section class="d-section" id="insights"><div class="d-wrap"><span class="d-eyebrow">DENTAL MARKETING / INSIGHTS</span><h2>Useful guides for the decisions ahead.</h2><p class="d-section-intro">Practical advice on dental advertising, consultation requests and follow-up operations.</p><div class="d-articles">{articles.map(([name,url,desc])=><a class="d-article" href={url}><strong>{name}</strong><span>{desc}</span><small>READ GUIDE ↗</small></a>)}</div></div></section>
    <section class="d-closing"><div class="d-wrap"><span class="d-eyebrow">LEADSFLO / DENTAL</span><h2>Let's make every inquiry easier to act on.</h2><p>Tell us which treatments you want to grow, where your practice operates and how your front desk handles incoming requests.</p><a class="d-btn gold" href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a dental growth conversation ↗</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="d-footer"><div class="d-wrap"><div class="d-footer-grid"><div><a href="/" class="d-logo dark" aria-label="LeadsFlo home"><BrandMark theme="dark" /><svg class="d-logo-icon" viewBox="0 0 30 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4C3 7 4 14 7 20l3 9c2 3 4-1 5-7 1-4 2-4 3 0 1 6 3 10 5 7l3-9c3-6 4-13-1-16-4-3-7 1-10 1S12 1 8 4Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></a><p>Connected dental marketing, inquiry qualification, follow-up and appointment-setting workflows.</p><a class="d-btn gold" href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Schedule a conversation ↗</a></div><nav aria-label="Dental footer services"><h3>Services</h3><a href="/performance-marketing/">Performance Marketing</a><a href="/websites-funnels/">Websites &amp; Funnels</a><a href="/crm-automation/">CRM &amp; Automation</a><a href="/appointment-setting/">Appointment Setting</a></nav><nav aria-label="Dental footer navigation"><h3>Explore</h3><a href="/industries/">Industries</a><a href="/insights/">Insights</a><a href="/our-approach/">Our Approach</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></nav></div><div class="d-footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} LeadsFlo</span><span><a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms-and-conditions/">Terms</a> · <a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></span></div></div></footer>
